{"verse_key": "14:17", "surah": 14, "verse": 17, "text_uthmani": "يَتَجَرَّعُهُۥ وَلَا يَكَادُ يُسِيغُهُۥ وَيَأْتِيهِ ٱلْمَوْتُ مِن كُلِّ مَكَانٍ وَمَا هُوَ بِمَيِّتٍ ۖ وَمِن وَرَآئِهِۦ عَذَابٌ غَلِيظٌ", "translation": "He will gulp it but will hardly [be able to] swallow it. And death will come to him from everywhere, but he is not to die. And before him is a massive punishment.", "verse_from_ms": 392420, "verse_to_ms": 415250, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/14.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "يَتَجَرَّعُهُۥ", "start_ms": 392420, "end_ms": 393380}, {"i": 1, "text": "وَلَا", "start_ms": 393380, "end_ms": 393600}, {"i": 2, "text": "يَكَادُ", "start_ms": 393600, "end_ms": 394660}, {"i": 3, "text": "يُسِيغُهُۥ", "start_ms": 394660, "end_ms": 398470}, {"i": 4, "text": "وَيَأْتِيهِ", "start_ms": 398470, "end_ms": 400050}, {"i": 5, "text": "ٱلْمَوْتُ", "start_ms": 400050, "end_ms": 400340}, {"i": 6, "text": "مِن", "start_ms": 400340, "end_ms": 401490}, {"i": 7, "text": "كُلِّ", "start_ms": 401490, "end_ms": 401940}, {"i": 8, "text": "مَكَانٍ", "start_ms": 401940, "end_ms": 404630}, {"i": 9, "text": "وَمَا", "start_ms": 404630, "end_ms": 405470}, {"i": 10, "text": "هُوَ", "start_ms": 405470, "end_ms": 405630}, {"i": 11, "text": "بِمَيِّتٍ", "start_ms": 405630, "end_ms": 406590}, {"i": 12, "text": "ۖ", "start_ms": 406590, "end_ms": 409325}, {"i": 13, "text": "وَمِن", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"i": 14, "text": "وَرَآئِهِۦ", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"i": 15, "text": "عَذَابٌ", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"i": 16, "text": "غَلِيظٌ", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}]}